{"id":"wb-6-857","name":"夹江千佛岩石窟","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"夾江千佛岩摩岩造像","text":"夹江千佛岩石窟位于四川省夹江县城郊，文物遗址年代判定为唐。1956年8月16日公布为四川省第一批历史及革命文物保护单位。大小共271龛。1980年7月7日重新公布为四川省第一批文物保护单位。2006年5月25日列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%BE%E6%B1%9F%E5%8D%83%E4%BD%9B%E5%B2%A9%E6%91%A9%E5%B2%A9%E9%80%A0%E5%83%8F","revisionId":86801016,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86801016","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/d9e4031a3ab9f109cba74682.jpg","title":"夹江千佛岩石窟照片.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%A4%B9%E6%B1%9F%E5%8D%83%E4%BD%9B%E5%B2%A9%E7%9F%B3%E7%AA%9F%E7%85%A7%E7%89%87.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7f/%E5%A4%B9%E6%B1%9F%E5%8D%83%E4%BD%9B%E5%B2%A9%E7%9F%B3%E7%AA%9F%E7%85%A7%E7%89%87.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Nekitarc","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Jiajiang Qianfoyan (thousand-buddha cliff) grottoes","width":320,"height":213}}